# .remember/ is local-only scratch — session buffers, daily notes, the handoff
# baton. It used to sync via .remember/.gitignore (an allowlist for remember.md
# and the rolled history); that file is now inert, since git never descends into
# an ignored directory. Nothing under .remember/ reaches the office checkout.
