# uWSGI touch-reload trigger — the deploy root's restart.txt (wsgi.ini names
# it). Touched by the nightly reload job on whichever host runs uWSGI; it is
# state, not config. Anchored to the root so a restart.txt someone adds under
# docs/ or rag_sources/ is still tracked.
/restart.txt

